SY_TALK("5zbZ830Fb-0",[[151,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[161,["When you seek truth,"]],[168,["how dynamic one can become,"]],[170,["you can see the way these artists are,"]],[174,["how the blessings of the truth helps you"]],[179,["in your self confidence and in the expression of your art."]],[185,["And also you must have seen how the people from the West,"]],[190,["who have had no training in Indian music which is very difficult,"]],[194,["how they have taken easily to it."]],[197,["In the same way the Indians have taken to Western music very easily."]],[204,["The reason is,"]],[206,["we have to understand what we are."]],[211,["And that is the truth one has to know."]],[214,["The truth is that you are the Spirit."]],[221,["You are not this body, this mind,"]],[225,["this ego, emotions,"]],[230,["but you are the Spirit."]],[233,["Until you become the Self, Spirit,"]],[237,["you cannot feel the All-Pervading Power,"]],[241,["which is very subtle."]],[244,["And this is another truth one has to realize,"]],[249,["that this Power exists"]],[252,["and it does all the living works,"]],[261,["it organizes, it thinks,"]],[267,["above all it loves you."]],[270,["But when I say this,"]],[274,["you have to have an open mind of a scientist."]],[279,["If, what I am saying, like a hypothesis,"]],[286,["turns out to be true,"]],[289,["then you have to accept it in all your honesty."]],[306,["The most important thing today"]],[308,["is to ask a question to ourselves,"]],[310,["”Why are we here? What is the purpose of our coming?”"]],[317,["If we ask such a question"]],[320,["then only a new search towards the truth will start."]],[325,["And these two things that I have told you,"]],[328,["that you are the Spirit"]],[331,["and that you have to be in connection with this All-Pervading Power,"]],[338,["will have to work it out for you"]],[341,["because then you become the seekers of truth. It's your right."]],[345,["So Sahaja means - ‘Saha’ means born with you."]],[349,["With - ‘Saha’ is with, ‘Ja’ is born."]],[352,["So born with you is the right"]],[355,["to be united - that is ‘Yoga’ - with this Divine Power."]],[360,["This is the real meaning of  ‘Yoga’ -"]],[362,["is that you are to be united with that Divine Power."]],[368,["The manifestation of this, when it happens,"]],[373,["you become a beautiful personality that you are."]],[378,["You become that glory that you are."]],[381,["And you rise into a new state"]],[384,["that we call as of ‘collective consciousness’."]],[389,["This is the process of your evolution."]],[395,["And this is the last breakthrough of our evolution,"]],[399,["where from human awareness you have to become"]],[404,["a realized soul, a person who is born again."]],[408,["Like the birds are also called as ’dvijaha’ in Sanskrit language,"]],[414,["meaning 'those who are born again';"]],[416,["meaning, first they come as eggs"]],[419,["and then they are born as birds. In the same way,"]],[421,["it has to happen to you."]],[424,["And once these things happen,"]],[426,["so many manifestations come through"]],[432,["and we get the beautiful blessings of this All-Pervading Power."]],[440,["The first thing that happens to you,"]],[443,["is that physically you feel fit."]],[445,["You feel fit with your own powers."]],[448,["No medicines are needed."]],[452,["No maneuvering is needed. Nothing is needed. You just,"]],[455,["from your own power, which is lying in the triangular bone here."]],[460,["Have you talked to them something about it? No, it is not. Just..."]],[463,["All right. In the triangular bone this Power lies"]],[467,["which is called as Kundalini."]],[470,["I think it is too far away for them to see."]],[473,["Can it be brought, can we bring it forward?"]],[478,["They can’t see it, so what's the use?"]],[493,["Now all of you can see it?"]],[497,["SY: This side. This side. Here."]],[499,["SM: It would be better? All right, this side."]],[503,["Can you see now?"]],[507,["Just this way a little bit. These are all Sahaja Yogis, aren’t they?"]],[511,["So, it is all right, for you need not see. You just put it this..."]],[515,["Just little at an angle, please."]],[517,["Yes, now is better? All right."]],[521,["So, this subtle system exists within us."]],[525,["And we have to understand this subtle system."]],[528,["Like all our civilizations has grown outward, like a tree."]],[532,["And whatever we have knowledge through science or any other method,"]],[537,["is the knowledge of the tree."]],[539,["But we have no knowledge of our roots."]],[542,["And that is why we are always under a threat of a shock"]],[547,["and God knows what's going to happen to us."]],[550,["If we know our roots,"]],[553,["then we know how to nourish this tree very well."]],[556,["Now here you see in the triangular bone, is this Power,"]],[561,["what we call as Kundalini in a Sanskrit word,"]],[564,["but ‘Kundal’ means coils,"]],[566,["coiled up into three and a half coils."]],[569,["And this Power is the residual power within us"]],[573,["which is waiting for that moment when it can be awakened."]],[578,["And like you have now connected by this cord to the mains,"]],[583,["this Power rises and connects you to the mains."]],[587,["By that you become a subtler personality,"]],[590,["you become that collective conscious personality,"]],[594,["you go beyond thoughts."]],[596,["And as I told you, physically, mentally and emotionally"]],[600,["you become absolutely a perfect personality."]],[605,["Apart from that, you achieve your peace of mind,"]],[609,["all your tensions disappear"]],[612,["and that you become a witness."]],[616,["Like a witness you see the play, the play of the Divine,"]],[621,["and the complete knowledge of the Divine and the subtle knowledge,"]],[627,["becomes your own; which is an absolute knowledge."]],[631,["Everybody who is in Sahaja Yoga knows the same thing."]],[636,["There is no argument, there is no fight,"]],[640,["there is no discussion."]],[642,["Because once you get this Realization,"]],[645,["when this Kundalini rises and passes through"]],[648,["six subtle centers above,"]],[651,["then you start feeling on your finger tips,"]],[655,["the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost, as they call it,"]],[658,["or we can say the All Pervading Power."]],[661,["Also you can feel the cool breeze, out of your fontanel bone area"]],[667,["when this Kundalini pierces through,"]],[669,["and that is the actualization of baptism."]],[675,["Is not artificial"]],[676,["that somebody puts the finger on your thing and say,"]],[679,["\"Now you are baptized.\""]],[681,["Baptism is a living process"]],[685,["and it's a living process of evolution"]],[689,["that gives you this new dimension to your awareness."]],[697,["Now the rising of the Kundalini is spontaneous"]],[702,["because it's a living process. Like if you have a seed,"]],[706,["it sprouts if you put it in the Mother Earth, spontaneously."]],[711,["We don’t have to stand [on] our heads"]],[713,["or to read some sort of a book or a scripture."]],[717,["It just happens."]],[718,["In the same way, spontaneously,"]],[721,["this power rises and connects you to the mains."]],[726,["As a result, as I told, you become dynamic,"]],[728,["you become extremely creative,"]],[732,["you feel very young, you work very hard, you don’t feel tired"]],[737,["and so many diseases automatically get cured by your own power,"]],[742,["by yourself."]],[744,["Nobody has to cure you. You just get absolutely cured out of it."]],[749,["For example, we have so many problems in the modern times,"]],[755,["of very different nature:"]],[758,["that people are overactive"]],[761,["and over activity takes them away from reality"]],[764,["and they become sort of slaves of over activity."]],[768,["This is done by the second center which is, you see, the yellow, the bile."]],[774,["This center is, for example,"]],[776,["I will tell you about one center at least today,"]],[779,["That this center is called as Swadisthana center"]],[783,["and which looks after, on the physical side,"]],[787,["and caters for aortic plexus."]],[791,["And this center has got a very important work to be done,"]],[794,["is to convert the fat for the replacement"]],[801,["of the grey cells of our brain."]],[804,["This is a very important work for people who are futuristic,"]],[808,["who are planning all the time, who are thinking too much."]],[811,["As a result all other functions of this center are neglected."]],[817,["And these other functions are, that it has to cater to your liver."]],[822,["Now liver has a job,"]],[824,["it has to transform the heat or the poison from your body,"]],[830,["as heat into the blood stream"]],[833,["so that it is thrown out."]],[836,["But when this center is busy"]],[840,["doing something else, so important,"]],[843,["this work is left undone or sometimes very much neglected."]],[848,["As a result one develops a bad system of liver."]],[853,["This liver creates heat,"]],[855,["does not throw out the heat from the body"]],[858,["which passes along and you get so many complications with it,"]],[863,["like asthma and others."]],[868,["Today we had a patient who came and she had the same problem."]],[872,["And she said, \"They have told me I have some viruses, this, that\","]],[876,["all kinds of diagnosis she told Me."]],[878,["I said, \"Nothing, you just have liver,"]],[881,["and you just try to improve your liver, you will be all right\"."]],[884,["Within ten minutes she said, \"I'm feeling all right\"."]],[887,["I said, \"That's it."]],[889,["You have a liver problem. So this virus is there,"]],[892,["that virus is there, all kinds of roundabout ways of saying"]],[896,["to show that it is absolutely incurable\"."]],[900,["Now, then you go from there"]],[903,["to another very important work, is that of the pancreas"]],[908,["which looks after or caters of dissolving your sugar."]],[914,["But when you have this pancreas in a mess,"]],[919,["because this center is not looking after it,"]],[924,["then you develop a horrible disease called diabetes."]],[927,["And this diabetes only happens to people"]],[930,["who sit down and think too much, who plan too much,"]],[933,["mostly to bureaucrats,"]],[936,["and maybe to politicians, I don’t know."]],[940,["But say in India, farmers ask for sugar"]],[944,["and if you give them tea, the sugar should be so much"]],[949,["that the spoon should stand at right angles, you see."]],[953,["Otherwise they'll think, \"This is no tea, this is horrible!\""]],[957,["And despite all that, they never get diabetes."]],[962,["But any bureaucrat who is too much of a planner"]],[966,["or a politician or someone like that, who thinks too much,"]],[971,["gets it even with one spoon,"]],[973,["maybe with the half spoon he gets diabetes."]],[976,["So this is due to the fact that this poor center"]],[980,["has to do some work for all these people"]],[984,["who are extra active with their brains"]],[987,["and other organs like pancreas, are neglected."]],[993,["Then third one is even more important, more dangerous is the spleen."]],[998,["The spleen is the one, which is, we can say,"]],[1001,["is the one which keeps the rhythm of life."]],[1004,["As you have seen the rhythmic work, it keeps the rhythm of life."]],[1008,["Now this rhythmic work,"]],[1012,["if we do not allow it to work with proper rhythm"]],[1015,["and we have become hectic,"]],[1017,["then this center has the job to create"]],[1022,["red blood corpuscles for the use of any emergencies."]],[1028,["Supposing you have taken your food and suddenly you want to run,"]],[1033,["then you get a pain here"]],[1035,["and you don’t know why you are getting the pain."]],[1037,["Because that time your spleen goes into action in a very frantic way"]],[1042,["and produces more RBCs, red blood corpuscles"]],[1046,["and with that, it has to work hard, you get that pain."]],[1052,["Now when you lead such a hectic life, all the time under shocks,"]],[1056,["like early in the morning we read the newspapers;"]],[1059,["one shock is sufficient."]],[1061,["Then secondly you have to have your breakfast,"]],[1065,["you can’t have time, you are in a busy, you are running away to work"]],[1069,["and on the way you find there is a jam."]],[1071,["Then you go, your boss also shouting at you for getting late,"]],[1075,["all kinds of time bound things, you see."]],[1078,["All these plays upon your spleen,"]],[1082,["and poor spleen doesn’t understand"]],[1084,["what sort of a personality is this one; is so hectic."]],[1087,["God knows, it requires red blood corpuscles now and then"]],[1091,["and like that, is so hectic, there is no rhythm about it..."]],[1095,["so it gets, you should say, crazy."]],[1098,["Then it becomes vulnerable, absolutely vulnerable"]],[1102,["for a disease called blood cancer."]],[1107,["Then at the same time,"]],[1109,["if on the left side there is some triggering done, triggering"]],[1114,["due to some shock or some sort of pain or unhappiness"]],[1117,["or something like that,"]],[1119,["this disease sets in."]],[1121,["Now people who have come to Sahaja Yoga, were certified"]],[1125,["to be dead within eight days also by doctors,"]],[1128,["who have suffered from this trouble,"]],[1130,["got themselves cured of blood cancer."]],[1133,["Cancer is also cured with it, no doubt."]],[1136,["But it is cured automatically by your own powers."]],[1139,["Nobody has to cure you. You just get cured by your own powers."]],[1143,["Once you get your Realization,"]],[1145,["and you know how to handle your own powers,"]],[1148,["how to treat yourself,"]],[1149,["first you can find out what is wrong with your centers,"]],[1152,["diagnosis is there,"]],[1154,["and you can find out also how to get it cured."]],[1157,["You can cure yourself"]],[1158,["and you can help others to get their Realization."]],[1162,["This is the power you get."]],[1163,["It is not just a certificate, a false certificate,"]],[1166,["that, \"I am a self-realized person, I am a twice-born person.\""]],[1178,["It has to be a certificate from yourself"]],[1183,["that you have to feel the cool breeze."]],[1185,["You have to feel that All Pervading Power."]],[1189,["You have to feel your peace and your silence within yourself."]],[1194,["So first of all when the Kundalini rises,"]],[1197,["She passes through this center"]],[1199,["which we call as Agnya,"]],[1201,["which is placed in the optic chasma."]],[1206,["When this passes through that it sucks in from both the sides,"]],[1209,["these two institutions which are created"]],[1212,["by our left and right sympathetic nervous system."]],[1215,["Whenever there is an emergency, the sympathetic goes into action."]],[1220,["So here we have an autonomous nervous system."]],[1223,["Autonomous nervous system is named by doctors."]],[1227,["We have to ask them, \"What do you mean by auto?"]],[1229,["Who is this 'auto'? Who does this job?\""]],[1231,["So we have left and right side of autonomous nervous system"]],[1235,["nourished by these two channels, left and right."]],[1238,["And when this autonomous nervous system starts working"]],[1242,["either on the desire side"]],[1245,["or we can say emotional side, on the left hand side,"]],[1247,["it creates an institution here, which we call as superego,"]],[1252,["or in Sanskrit called as ‘Mana’,"]],[1254,["where all our conditionings are stored up."]],[1257,["And on the other side, if the right side is too much excited,"]],[1263,["if a person is too much futuristic"]],[1266,["and is using too much his mental and physical capacities,"]],[1270,["then there is another institution"]],[1271,["that is created on top of your head,"]],[1274,["which we call as ‘ego’."]],[1277,["These two meet and sometimes overlap"]],[1281,["and so we close our fontanel bone area"]],[1284,["which was a soft bone in your childhood."]],[1288,["So when this Kundalini passes through this center"]],[1292,["which we call as Agnya Chakra,"]],[1294,["it sucks in these two institutions. So your karmas are sucked in"]],[1298,["and your conditionings are sucked in"]],[1301,["and it comes down like this, it opens this area,"]],[1306,["Kundalini pierces through this."]],[1308,["Now this is a spontaneous thing happening."]],[1311,["It is not that you have to do something about it."]],[1314,["As the car starts, all the machinery starts working,"]],[1318,["this also starts working."]],[1320,["But, in... say, \"This is modern Raja yoga is there,"]],[1323,["Hatha yoga is there\", everybody ask Me question after the lecture,"]],[1327,["so it is better I tell you about it already,"]],[1330,["that this so called Raja yoga is something"]],[1333,["like when the car has not yet started,"]],[1337,["the machinery won’t start."]],[1339,["So without starting the car you start moving the wheels"]],[1342,["is the modern's Raja yoga."]],[1344,["They even cut the tongues of, I mean"]],[1347,["not the tongues but the threads of the tongues of people,"]],[1350,["to push back the tongue,"]],[1353,["so that it can stop the Kundalini."]],[1356,["But when the Kundalini is rising by itself, it stops."]],[1361,["It stops every area it crosses through."]],[1366,["Supposing it comes to this area, then when it passes through it,"]],[1371,["it has to go into an augmentation, into constriction"]],[1375,["to stop that Kundalini falling down."]],[1378,["So it is done automatically."]],[1380,["As we eat our food it gets digested, in the same way it happens."]],[1384,["But artificially it is not to be done."]],[1388,["And all these artificial doing is of no help."]],[1391,["Same about Hatha yoga. Is ‘ha´-`tha’, is two words there,"]],[1396,["meaning the sun line and the moon line,"]],[1398,["meaning the left and the right side channel, both are to be used."]],[1401,["But when we do Hatha yoga in the modern times,"]],[1405,["we are just trying to do only physical exercises"]],[1408,["which is a very wee, wee part of the Patanjali yoga,"]],[1411,["out of which Hatha yoga has come."]],[1414,["In the Patanjali yoga is described that"]],[1417,["you have to see a person who has got problems on his physical side."]],[1421,["Supposing now somebody has had an accident or something"]],[1425,["and the back bone is not all right and there is a problem on that."]],[1429,["So you have to correct it."]],[1431,["But this correction is the best once the Kundalini is up,"]],[1435,["so you know where is the problem"]],[1437,["and then is to be corrected scientifically."]],[1439,["Not to be done in a haphazard manner."]],[1441,["And sometimes the people do Hatha yoga in the way,"]],[1444,["that as if they are taking all the medicine boxes together,"]],[1449,["without any discrimination."]],[1451,["So you should have discrimination about it"]],[1453,["and you should find out what’s wrong"]],[1455,["and then do exactly whatever is needed to be done."]],[1460,["Not to do everything blindly."]],[1462,["So the first thing, the blessings of Sahaja Yoga is"]],[1465,["that you get to know all the knowledge."]],[1467,["It is not just you say this mantra,"]],[1469,["you do this thing, you do, nothing of that kind."]],[1472,["You first become the Spirit."]],[1475,["And you know everything about it, what it is."]],[1478,["You experience it, you find out for yourself, you certify yourself"]],[1483,["and then you have to work it out."]],[1486,["So it is a very practical, pragmatic thing."]],[1490,["Of course you can’t pay for all these things."]],[1492,["Those who are paying for this must know is a wrong thing,"]],[1495,["because it's a living process."]],[1497,["For a living process how can you pay?"]],[1500,["It's something absurd but people don’t understand"]],[1502,["that you cannot pay for it"]],[1505,["because they don’t feel confident"]],[1507,["if you don’t have to pay for something."]],[1509,["The other day I was in Cairns,"]],[1512,["and there is a Sahaja Yogini and she said, \"Mother,"]],[1514,["they wouldn’t come to a program for which you don’t have to pay.\""]],[1518,["\"So then, what did you do?\""]],[1520,["She said, \"I told them I will take 50 dollars from you.\""]],[1524,["They all came with 50 dollars, quite happy and satisfied."]],[1528,["So she took 50 dollars from them,"]],[1530,["gave them Realization, worked it out"]],[1533,["and then she returned the money saying,"]],[1535,["\"I don’t need this money, sorry.\""]],[1538,["But this kind of a psychology, I can’t understand"]],[1541,["that we are so much used to payment in everything"]],[1545,["that we cannot understand one thing, that"]],[1548,["Divine doesn’t know what is payment is."]],[1550,["How much do we pay for this Mother Earth for sprouting everything,"]],[1554,["for giving us beautiful trees and things?"]],[1556,["How much did we do for Her that we have to pay for it?"]],[1559,["But this is something we don’t understand in the West."]],[1562,["In India they do because they know"]],[1565,["that Divine has no sense of money."]],[1568,["It doesn’t know banking, doesn’t know insurance,"]],[1571,["nothing of the kind."]],[1573,["And this is what we have to understand first of all"]],[1575,["that if we have to become a divine personality,"]],[1579,["we must respect it as a pure thing."]],[1583,["It doesn’t need any money, it doesn’t need anything."]],[1587,["It just needs one thing which is the pure desire within you,"]],[1591,["because this is the power of pure desire,"]],[1594,["the desire that, \"I have to become one with the Divine.\""]],[1599,["All other desires are impure,"]],[1601,["because no desire when fulfilled, gives you satisfaction."]],[1606,["You jump from one desire to another desire."]],[1609,["That’s why it is said in economics that in general"]],[1613,["the desires and wants are not satiable."]],[1617,["But this is the desire that we have."]],[1619,["And once this desire is fulfilled,"]],[1622,["we become absolutely contented, satisfied"]],[1627,["and a complete balance is established within ourselves."]],[1631,["All these ecological problems settle down"]],[1634,["because the imbalance in the human beings itself"]],[1638,["creates the imbalance outside."]],[1641,["Whatever are human problems are projected outside."]],[1645,["These are not problems"]],[1647,["which have come from nature, but are created by us."]],[1650,["Because of our problems these problems arise."]],[1655,["So somehow if we can manage to put ourself in proper line,"]],[1659,["everything will be fine and we will live in a new era of,"]],[1666,["what we call the Golden Age,"]],[1668,["and we enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[1671,["Because then you will realize, yourself experience"]],[1674,["that every moment is so surprising,"]],[1676,["how it works out, how things just help you"]],[1681,["and how you manage to get over difficulties without any trouble!"]],[1687,["It is something so wonderful, so fantastic!"]],[1690,["And is sometimes people will be skeptical about it."]],[1693,["They will think how can that be?"]],[1695,["But supposing there is a television set"]],[1697,["I take it to the ignorant people in our Indian villages"]],[1701,["and show them and say that"]],[1703,["\"You can see all kinds of films in this one\","]],[1705,["They will say, \"What, this box! How can it show?\""]],[1707,["So we treat ourselves as that box."]],[1710,["But actually when you put it to the mains,"]],[1711,["you know how fantastic it is."]],[1714,["So, we are not created just for nothing."]],[1716,["We are created for a special work,"]],[1718,["only thing is we have to know our Self."]],[1721,["And all the scriptures and religions have said ‘know thy self’."]],[1725,["But all of them have gone astray, absolutely astray,"]],[1730,["they have become all man-made sort of things."]],[1733,["And that is why people are in complete disillusionment about them."]],[1739,["But whosoever created them,"]],[1742,["all those great prophets, incarnations"]],[1745,["are absolutely truthful people and they told the truth."]],[1750,["All the saints were truthful people."]],[1753,["And we have to learn from them"]],[1755,["and we ourselves have to become saints."]],[1757,["We don’t have to give up our families,"]],[1759,["we don’t have to do all this nonsensical things which are outside."]],[1762,["The detachment works out within yourself."]],[1765,["Everything works out within yourself"]],[1767,["and I am sure today, in Brisbane,"]],[1769,["we'll be achieving it for all of you."]],[1772,["Because modern Sahaja Yoga is an en masse happening."]],[1777,["Formerly, only one or two people used to get Realization;"]],[1780,["on the tree of life there were only one or two flowers."]],[1784,["But today I call it a blossom time."]],[1786,["And also this is the Day of Judgment,"]],[1790,["where we judge ourselves."]],[1792,["In the Koran it is said that your hands would speak"]],[1795,["and you will judge yourself."]],[1797,["But even the Muslims are not following what He said,"]],[1800,["even the Christians are not following what Christ has said,"]],[1803,["even the Hindus are not following what their Scriptures have said."]],[1806,["They are all having a nice"]],[1809,["money-oriented or power-oriented organization."]],[1813,["That is not going to help us."]],[1815,["We have to have the Reality, the Truth."]],[1818,["It is for our benevolence,"]],[1821,["for the benevolence of our children,"]],[1823,["for the benevolence of the whole world."]],[1826,["That is how the whole humanity has to emancipate."]],[1829,["And that's what I am here to tell you about."]],[1832,["May God bless you all!"]],[1838,["We are rather time bound because they told Me"]],[1843,["that your conveyance is a problem here"]],[1847,["and that I should finish everything before 9.30."]],[1851,["So I have to tell you one thing that if you could"]],[1856,["ask Me some questions that you have, relevant questions,"]],[1859,["because I am not here to take anything from you."]],[1861,["I am here just to tell you what you are"]],[1864,["and to see that you get what you have."]],[1866,["So if you have any relevant questions,"]],[1868,["please ask Me for a few minutes."]],[1872,["And then we will have the session for Realization"]],[1875,["that will take about ten minutes."]],[1877,["So I'll be very happy if you could ask Me questions about it."]],[1882,["One thing I have to say and excuse Myself"]],[1885,["that in a one-day lecture,"]],[1888,["I cannot cover the whole subject."]],[1891,["It is an ocean of knowledge."]],[1893,["And this ocean of knowledge can be understood better"]],[1896,["when you have Self Realization,"]],[1898,["the light of your Spirit in your attention."]],[1902,["You will understand it much better."]],[1905,["But there are My lectures, so many, thousands of them"]],[1908,["in English language itself."]],[1910,["So you can listen to them also."]],[1912,["But first, the best thing is to get your Realization."]],[1916,["For example there are so many lights here"]],[1918,["and when you come in"]],[1920,["what you do is to just switch on and the whole thing comes up."]],[1923,["But supposing I have tell you everything about the electricity,"]],[1927,["the discovery of electricity, then how it was brought here,"]],[1931,["and in Brisbane how it was arranged, it will be a headache."]],[1934,["So best is to get the lights"]],[1936,["and then we'lll know more about the knowledge of it."]],[1940,["May God bless you!"]],[1950,["M: I would like to know how to perform meditation."]],[1956,["SY: He'd like to know how to perform meditation."]],[1959,["SM: It's good question. That is what I am going to do now."]],[1962,["You do not do meditation"]],[1964,["but you are in meditation."]],[1967,["It is a state. It is a state in which you rise,"]],[1971,["where you become thoughtlessly aware to begin with."]],[1974,["You are aware but there is no thought."]],[1976,["And whenever you want to think, you will think,"]],[1978,["otherwise you can stop your thoughts. That is first state."]],[1981,["And the second one is called as doubtless awareness"]],[1985,["where you have no doubts left about it"]],[1988,["and you just become so powerful"]],[1990,["that you can give Realizations to others,"]],[1993,["you can do so many things, which normally you could have never done."]],[1997,["These two states are to be achieved."]],[1999,["So we don’t have to do meditation as such,"]],[2002,["it just will work out. You will be in meditation."]],[2008,["L: Can you put it [louder]? I am not hearing You..."]],[2012,["SY: Not hearing very well?","L: No, I am not."]],[2014,["SY: Do you hear [unclear]?"]],[2019,["SM: What is it?"]],[2022,["What is it?"]],[2024,["SY: The speakers, there is a noise in the speakers and I want to see..."]],[2028,["SM: There is a noise on? Some sort of a noise ..."]],[2033,["Next time we will have better arrangements for you."]],[2038,["But whatever may be the problem,"]],[2040,["you will get your Realizations all right."]],[2050,["What is it?"]],[2053,["SY: She wants me to give you another mike or something."]],[2056,["Is not good?"]],[2067,["SY: She wants to know, does reincarnation affect individual spirits?"]],[2073,["SM: Individual spirits?"]],[2078,["I didn't...","SY: That is the question. Could you...?"]],[2080,["L: You know, about rebirth, do we all reincarnate?"]],[2083,["Do we all have another life?"]],[2085,["SY: Do we all reincarnate?"]],[2087,["SM: Of course. No doubt."]],[2090,["You see you must logically understand."]],[2094,["Now supposing you were in a certain century"]],[2099,["and you had committed some mistakes, supposing,"]],[2103,["or you have done something good,"]],[2106,["or you were searching something,"]],[2109,["you were wanting something."]],[2112,["Then, I mean,"]],[2114,["you are not going to be condemned by one life, isn’t it?"]],[2119,["Because God Almighty is the ocean of forgiveness"]],[2125,["and He loves you"]],[2126,["and He wants you to enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[2129,["So He gives you more chances."]],[2132,["I will tell you one thing that we had a driver"]],[2136,["and he was a very quiet and very stately personality."]],[2141,["And he told Me that he has become a driver"]],[2148,["because in last life he must have been some king"]],[2153,["and the king must have been over burdened with work."]],[2157,["So the king must have thought is better to be a driver"]],[2160,["and there is no burdening of this,"]],[2163,["\"So, I have become a driver and very happy about it\"."]],[2167,["In the same way, you see, things can happen"]],[2170,["that you are searching for something."]],[2172,["Like somebody wants to marry some lady."]],[2174,["I mean is just mad"]],[2176,["and he suffers from Greek tragedy you can call it,"]],[2179,["and goes into a kind of a nonsensical ideas,"]],[2181,["doesn’t love his wife and just thinks of another woman all the time,"]],[2186,["and thinks that, \"I should get married to her\"."]],[2189,["So the next life, the Divine says, \"All right, have her!\""]],[2193,["And then he says, \"Oh, God! What a wife! Better run away.\""]],[2198,["So he learns a lesson."]],[2199,["So it is like giving lessons in your different lives."]],[2203,["Is very important"]],[2205,["because God is not going to just damn you like that,"]],[2208,["that you are good for nothing, is not going to stamp you like that."]],[2211,["Is a wrong idea."]],[2213,["And because Christ also has said, \"I will come again\"."]],[2216,["If He had not believed in reincarnation why did He say that?"]],[2221,["Very irrelevant."]],[2233,["It has, you see in the, between the lines you must be able to read."]],[2238,["And that is the problem is that, between the lines we cannot read"]],[2241,["because we are not realized souls."]],[2243,["Once we are realized souls"]],[2246,["we start seeing everything between the lines."]],[2248,["Otherwise we cannot understand."]],[2250,["And the whole thing becomes superficial"]],[2253,["and people who are interested only in money building and all that"]],[2257,["start some sort of a wrong idea"]],[2259,["and we get absolutely deluded by them."]],[2275,["M: What is the place of Christ in them? What is [the relation]?"]],[2281,["SM: What is the...?"]],[2283,["SY: He said where is Christ in this set up and what is the relation?"]],[2287,["SM: On the Agnya, on the Agnya chakra.","M: But what is the relation?"]],[2292,["SM: You see because He is on the optic chiasma"]],[2294,["which we, sometimes people call it \"a third eye\"."]],[2298,["He is on the Agnya chakra."]],[2299,["Now what I am saying is - you can verify it on your vibrations -"]],[2303,["because when the Kundalini rises"]],[2305,["and She comes up to the Agnya chakra,"]],[2308,["you have to say Lord’s prayer."]],[2310,["And that’s how He has died for our sins."]],[2315,["He has died for our sins means, He, once He is awakened,"]],[2319,["that all our conditionings and all our ego is sucked in."]],[2323,["He is a very, very important gate through which we have to pass."]],[2328,["He said “I am the gate”."]],[2330,["He didn’t say, \"I am the destination\", but \"I am the gate\"."]],[2333,["Very clear."]],[2335,["Christ's life you cannot understand"]],[2337,["unless and until you have your Realization. Not at all."]],[2339,["Through these priests and all that, you cannot understand it at all."]],[2343,["Specially, Mr. Paul, I don’t know how he appeared in the scene,"]],[2347,["because he himself was epileptic"]],[2349,["and some sort of an experience he had,"]],[2353,["and this spoiling Christianity has","been criticized by so many people."]],[2356,["Recently I read a book written by a very good German priest"]],[2361,["when Christ was in India,"]],[2363,["and he has absolutely condemned Paul in Christianity;"]],[2367,["he said he has brought all kinds of things"]],[2370,["which are not relevant to Christ."]],[2373,["Then also there was a book written by Thomas"]],[2377,["who was travelling to India"]],[2379,["and on his way he stopped in Egypt"]],[2382,["where he wrote lot of treatises"]],[2384,["and also wrote about what Christ had said it"]],[2388,["and was kept in a big jar."]],[2390,["And he called all these people who followed Christ, as ‘gnostics’."]],[2394,["Gnostics - those who know, ‘Gna’."]],[2396,["‘Gna’ word comes from the word ‘jnana’."]],[2399,["‘Jnana’ means to know on your central nervous system."]],[2402,["Is also in Buddhist thing, is called as ‘ Boddha’."]],[2406,["‘Buddh’, ‘ Boddha’ is to know on your central nervous system."]],[2409,["And also, say in the Hindu scriptures is called as ‘vida’"]],[2415,["means from where the word ‘Veda’ comes,"]],[2417,["that you have to know on your central nervous system."]],[2421,["Now, this book has been now after 48 years,"]],[2425,["it has been now decoded and found out and"]],[2427,["there was a very nice program on this."]],[2430,["And it was all challenging, all these ideas of Paul in Christianity."]],[2435,["You don’t have to suffer. He said, \"Why should you suffer?\","]],[2439,["because God Almighty is the Father of all the fathers,"]],[2442,["and why should we ask you to suffer?"]],[2445,["Christ has already suffered for you."]],[2447,["Now, you are not going to suffer more."]],[2449,["So many things like that and also about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2452,["that it’s a spontaneous experience which must be experienced"]],[2455,["and must be felt on the central nervous system."]],[2459,["He said so clearly, on your nerves, as he said it."]],[2463,["So, this book has been written down"]],[2466,["and is known as \"The Gnostics\"."]],[2468,["If you can get hold of it, please go through it."]],[2471,["It’s a wonderful book which will give you full idea"]],[2474,["as to what Thomas wrote about."]],[2476,["And these people were called as ‘Gnostics’."]],[2478,["They were not called as Christians,"]],[2480,["but ‘Gnostics’ means the ones who have known."]],[2483,["Known what? Known, not through your brains,"]],[2485,["but known on your central nervous system."]],[2488,["As in Sanskrit language is called as ’Gynanis’."]],[2498,["M: Could You tell us a bit more about the rising of the Kundalini,"]],[2501,["when this Kundalini rise, can we make Kundalini rise?"]],[2505,["Is it dangerous [unclear]?"]],[2509,["SY: Could You tell us some more about Kundalini. Is it dangerous to rise?"]],[2514,["SM: No, not at all. This [part], I should have covered Myself."]],[2517,["Not at all, is never dangerous, you see."]],[2520,["It’s your Mother. She is your individual Mother."]],[2524,["When you were born your mother took all the labor pains upon herself."]],[2528,["She didn’t give you any pain."]],[2530,["In the same way She is your Mother"]],[2533,["and that’s a Mother energy, that is the primordial Mother"]],[2536,["which is reflected in you."]],[2538,["That’s the Holy Ghost. They didn’t talk of Mother"]],[2541,["but they said it is a dove."]],[2542,["I don’t know why they said it,"]],[2544,["but this is the Primordial Mother, no doubt."]],[2546,["Because you have the God, the Father,"]],[2550,["God the Son,"]],[2551,["and what about the Mother?"]],[2553,["That's the Holy Ghost.  It is a mystery."]],[2556,["It's no mystery for us."]],[2558,["You will know that the Holy Ghost is nothing else"]],[2560,["but the Primordial Mother called as ‘Adi Shakti’"]],[2564,["and by so many names."]],[2565,["Like here is the river, is called as ‘Parramatta’,"]],[2568,["is the Primordial Mother. Is a absolutely a Sanskrit word."]],[2572,["`Parramatta´ is absolutely Sanskrit word"]],[2575,["saying Primordial Mother [Param Mata]."]],[2578,["So this Mother is not going to give any trouble to you whatsoever."]],[2583,["And those who say so, because they do not know how to do it,"]],[2587,["they want to frighten you and keep you away from reality."]],[2592,["They have no authority. If they had divine authority,"]],[2594,["if they had some ways and methods of saying so,"]],[2597,["they would have said so."]],[2599,["Like many people also say that the time has also not come."]],[2602,["Because they don’t know how to do it."]],[2605,["That’s why they are postponing it. It is very selfish, I should say,"]],[2610,["or all self-opiniatedness that to say that this is so and this is so."]],[2615,["The Kundalini of course will never trouble you."]],[2618,["But if you try wrong methods"]],[2620,["then naturally there is a heat in the body"]],[2622,["and the deities get angry with you,"]],[2625,["the innocence gets angry and tortures you."]],[2629,["These false gurus who have come all over,"]],[2632,["I am ashamed of them and they are the ones"]],[2634,["who have mesmerized and taken money from you."]],[2637,["I mean how can they take money from you"]],[2639,["and how can they be your gurus when they are taking"]],[2641,["all this kind of money from you? Just think of it."]],[2645,["They are just you have retained them,"]],[2647,["they are like your servants I should say."]],[2649,["They have no self respect."]],[2654,["All right, you can pay for this hall all right."]],[2657,["But you can’t pay for your Self Realization."]],[2670,["L: Do You teach a system of [unclear] the chakras"]],[2677,["is necessary and do You describe [unclear]."]],[2683,["SY: Do You teach a method of cleansing the chakras?"]],[2686,["SM: Of course, of course.","L: [unclear]  SM: Of course."]],[2692,["We have a very good center here"]],[2694,["and we have very capable Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2697,["those who know how to cleanse your own chakras and everything."]],[2701,["Of course, that's the minimum."]],[2706,["And you yourself will be equipped with it."]],[2709,["You yourself will know all these things."]],[2713,["All that will be done. Is not just this lecture."]],[2717,["There is a follow on. Please, all of you should come."]],[2720,["It is not only Me, they also know everything"]],[2723,["and you will also know everything. That’s how it is going to spread."]],[2726,["Like one enlightened light enlightens another"]],[2729,["and then that enlightened light enlightens another person."]],[2733,["They are very very equipped here. They know everything about it."]],[2736,["They have My lectures and things also."]],[2738,["The main thing is they know everything"]],[2740,["and you have to know everything yourself."]],[2749,["L: May I just ask You, humans don't carry the burden of original sin?"]],[2755,["SY: Do we still carry the burden of original sin?"]],[2758,["SM: No, not at all. It’s over now. Time is over."]],[2762,["The original sin only brought us to ignorance"]],[2765,["and we started searching ourselves."]],[2767,["Otherwise things would have been much better"]],[2769,["if we had not gone into it."]],[2771,["But whatever it is, is now"]],[2773,["you had to come through a very circuitous way to understand."]],[2776,["Because human beings, you see, as they were at that time, also"]],[2781,["wanted to find out about themselves."]],[2783,["So God said, \"All right, you have this freedom.\""]],[2786,["Only human beings have the freedom, not the animals."]],[2789,["Animals are called as ‘Pashu’ means they are under bond,"]],[2792,["they are under the bondage of God,"]],[2794,["and is already all controlled by Him."]],[2797,["For example a scorpion is a scorpion, snake is a snake,"]],[2801,["they keep to their own dharma, means their own valences,"]],[2805,["their own religion, we can call it."]],[2807,["They don’t change. But human beings can be a scorpion,"]],[2810,["can be lion, can be tiger, can be anything."]],[2814,["They just shoot out like Jack in the box, you know."]],[2817,["Sometimes you don’t know what’s the matter"]],[2819,["now suddenly from where it is coming?"]],[2822,["Is interesting, isn’t it?"]],[2824,["But then once you are realized you see it as drama,"]],[2826,["and you just see that whole thing is just working out"]],[2830,["in a very funny manner."]],[2832,["You don’t take it so seriously as we normally do."]],[2835,["And you just enjoy everything."]],[2837,["And by your own countenance, by your own temperament,"]],[2840,["by your own character, people change."]],[2843,["And they ask, \"How are you like this?\""]],[2846,["Then you say that \"We have become Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2849,["so they come to you and they become Sahaja Yogis, too."]],[2852,["It's a wonderful area, it's a wonderful time"]],[2855,["and such wonderful people all over the world."]],[2858,["Like I went to USSR, you will be surprised, USSR."]],[2861,["And I never expected, they never have heard of any God or anything,"]],[2866,["and Christ also, they were just keeping Him aloof."]],[2869,["And there it is the people,"]],[2871,["thousands they came and they got Realization,"]],[2874,["settled down into them, very deep people."]],[2876,["They touched their depth. I was amazed. But the best part of it,"]],[2879,["that the Germans went to give them Realization."]],[2882,["25 Germans rushed there, to help Me out. I was amazed, you see."]],[2888,["And I said, \"It must have cost you\" , but they said, \"Mother,"]],[2891,["what is the money for? We have to come for Russians\"."]],[2894,["And such love and such understanding, you see."]],[2897,["I was really touched by their beauty."]],[2899,["Can you imagine Germans giving Realization to Russians?"]],[2905,["So beautiful it is to see their beauty expressing itself."]],[2914,["Yes.","SY: One raised at the back."]],[2918,["M: [unclear]."]],[2921,["How it will, what it represents [unclear]?"]],[2926,["How is it the divine state?"]],[2928,["And [unclear] what is guiding us now?"]],[2932,["And is it possible that some people have"]],[2935,["without particular effort  [unclear]."]],[2939,["SM: What is he saying?"]],[2966,["What is he talking?"]],[2968,["M: Mother, if rising Kundalini is what [unclear] ,"]],[2971,["how would You describe the current state?"]],[2974,["And what is it that is driving us now?"]],[2977,["SM: Driving you?"]],[2979,["SY: No, he said Kundalini is the [unclear] thing."]],[2982,["Then Kundalini rises and that's how we wake up all of them,"]],[2986,["and that Realization [rises], Mother."]],[2988,["What is the current state and what about the state are we [now]?"]],[2991,["SM: No, you are at a state which we call as human awareness at its best."]],[2996,["When you start thinking \"Why am I here on this earth?\","]],[3000,["you are trying to find out, because you see many things"]],[3005,["which do not satisfy you and you think this is not absolute."]],[3008,["Why there are so many opinions about everything?"]],[3011,["Why people think differently?"]],[3014,["And all these things come to your mind."]],[3016,["then you become what we call as a seeker of truth."]],[3019,["Is that is the state, is ‘Sadaka’ and that seeking brings you here."]],[3024,["And then you get your Realization."]],[3026,["Those who are not seekers, I cannot force it on anyone."]],[3029,["It has to work out, only on seekers."]],[3032,["Those who just want to sort of test it and things like that"]],[3035,["doesn’t work out. Those who are really seeking the truth, it works out."]],[3038,["I am sorry, it cannot be guaranteed for everyone."]],[3041,["If you are really seeking the truth, it works out,"]],[3044,["otherwise it does not."]],[3046,["So these are..."]],[3048,["This is the capacity in which you are here to seek the truth."]],[3051,["All right?"]],[3057,["L: Could Mother talk on intellect and Self Realization"]],[3061,["and part that intellect plays [as part of the] Self Relaization."]],[3066,["SY: What part does intellect play in the Self Realization?"]],[3070,["SM: After Realization, if you are really intelligent,"]],[3073,["in the way I would say that, detached intelligent,"]],[3077,["then you see it much better than anybody else."]],[3080,["Because you see it and you are honest,"]],[3082,["you see that this is what is happening."]],[3085,["And you are surprised. And you learn things much faster than others."]],[3090,["So, I call it, it is a person who has a super intelligence, I call it,"]],[3094,["intelligence which has already reached a state to see"]],[3098,["that this is not true, this is not true."]],[3100,["You reach a point when you know this is not true."]],[3102,["That is the point you hit the right thing."]],[3104,["So intelligence is very helpful."]],[3107,["And you will be surprised, we have Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3110,["most of them, of very intelligent..."]],[3113,["They are first class, first of this university,"]],[3115,["first class, first of that university, I mean all of them are there."]],[3118,["So you meet a person who has that sharp intelligence"]],[3122,["to see things also."]],[3123,["Also a person who is not so intelligent,"]],[3127,["but is so dedicated and is so loving,"]],[3131,["so purely loving people out of just love that is in,"]],[3135,["such people are also very good."]],[3136,["But in any case you don’t first judge yourself,"]],[3139,["that is the first point. You are not to judge,"]],[3141,["your Kundalini knows you very well."]],[3143,["So please don’t judge yourself, let your Kundalini judge you."]],[3146,["Now should we have now the session for...?"]],[3149,["SY: It's just one question.","SM: One more? Yes, say..."]],[3151,["M: Is that [unclear] of the yoga before...  hatha yoga?"]],[3156,["Could you speak on Kriya Yoga?"]],[3158,["SM: Same thing, Kriya Yoga is the same, which I told you or Raja."]],[3162,["Sahaja Yoga is ’a-Kriya’ yoga."]],[3164,["‘Kriya’ means when you do something is ‘Kriya Yoga'"]],[3167,["and “A-Kriya’ yoga is Sahaja Yoga."]],[3170,["I don’t do anything."]],[3171,["Without doing anything it works out, is the point."]],[3174,["But, of course, you have to know your centers,"]],[3177,["you have to know how to nourish them, that is different."]],[3180,["But ’Kriya’ yoga is something as I've told you,"]],[3183,["is just like ‘Raja yoga’."]],[3184,["Without starting the Kundalini,"]],[3186,["you start sort of moving your chakras and things,"]],[3189,["it doesn’t work out."]],[3192,["That's it."]],[3194,["It has reached nowhere. You see, you must see the results."]],[3198,["You must see the results."]],[3199,["First of all when you go to any one of them,"]],[3201,["first you must see those who have been there,"]],[3205,["and see what is their capability, how they are."]],[3208,["Unless and until you see them,"]],[3210,["why should you go to those people?"]],[3215,["Because they claim something, you shouldn’t."]],[3217,["You must find out what are their disciples like? How are they?"]],[3220,["What sort of people they are? What have they achieved?"]],[3223,["And then go there. As a Mother, I would say"]],[3225,["what, what has these gurus given you? Nothing."]],[3228,["They have made you broke."]],[3230,["You have... so many are bankrupt, so many are sick,"]],[3233,["so many people are sick."]],[3235,["This Rajnish’s disciples are so sick, you don’t know."]],[3238,["When they come to Me, first they faint."]],[3240,["I get so frightened with them."]],[3242,["They faint, actually. You see, I'm really frightened, poor things."]],[3250,["Horrible diseases have been created by them,"]],[3253,["and some people have got blood cancer from them."]],[3255,["All kinds of things have happened."]],[3257,["Is all very bad type of mesmerism,"]],[3260,["which you will know what it is later on."]],[3262,["So those who have been to these gurus also are suffering today."]],[3266,["You pay to get sick. Can you imagine?"]],[3277,["And you are all seekers, you see, that's My concern."]],[3280,["So every seeker has a right to get his yoga."]],[3283,["Every seeker has a right. No doubt."]],[3287,["But if you are not seeking, I cannot force on you. I cannot."]],[3291,["I respect your freedom. If you want you can go to heaven,"]],[3295,["if you want you can go to hell. It is very simple."]],[3298,["One boy asked Me, \"How do you go to hell?\""]],[3300,["I said, \"You take two running jumps and you are there.\""]],[3305,["What a question to ask?"]],[3309,["When I am talking of heaven, he is asking about hell."]],[3311,["So, I said this is what it is."]],[3319,["Now, finished I think."]],[3321,["Now, madam, again."]],[3323,["I think... Can we postpone it now?"]],[3326,["All right. You see what I am saying all these questions,"]],[3329,["even if I answer - because I'm very good at answering every question"]],[3333,["and I don’t have to think about them -"]],[3336,["but that answer is not sufficient."]],[3339,["You have to get your awakening."]],[3341,["That is not sufficient to satisfy you. It is not going to work out."]],[3345,["You have to get it, is the point. All right?"]],[3355,["Now as I have told you, those who do not want to have it,"]],[3358,["should please leave the hall."]],[3361,["There is no problem on that. I will never feel bad about it,"]],[3364,["because also you must know there's"]],[3369,["no force can be done."]],[3372,["Those who really want it should be here and should oblige."]],[3375,["That's being very civil."]],[3382,["Those people who are standing can sit here and they... yes..."]],[3409,["SY: [Shri Ma] should we put the air-conditioning off?"]],[3412,["Should we put the air-conditioning off so that is clear it's not..."]],[3417,["SM: No, I mean, they won’t doubt it."]],[3419,["SY: Just mention it."]],[3424,["SM: If you want we can put off the air conditioning"]],[3427,["because then you should not doubt"]],[3429,["that you got cool breeze out of your head."]],[3431,["After all your head is giving the cool breeze,"]],[3433,["that doesn’t mean the air conditioning"]],[3435,["is coming through your head, isn’t it?"]],[3445,["Actually, you see, people doubt"]],[3447,["because they don’t know what to expect."]],[3449,["But for us it is very easy to understand,"]],[3453,["because already described what to expect after Self Realization,"]],[3456,["is described by Adi Shankaracharya"]],[3459,["‘salilam’, ’salilam’, is the cool breeze."]],[3462,["Also cool breeze of the Holy Ghost is described in the Bible,"]],[3465,["also described the tree of life, which is this one."]],[3468,["So many things, but you see, is not so clear cut."]],[3471,["As it is Christ had very little time to talk to people."]],[3474,["I mean, just imagine He was crucified."]],[3477,["How much time they gave Him to talk publicly?"]],[3480,["I am the only one who has outclassed all, lots of things."]],[3484,["Because now I am 67 and nobody lived like Me for so many years."]],[3489,["They just finished Him off at a very early age."]],[3493,["That is the trouble. Nobody understood them."]],[3496,["No saint has lived as long as I have lived so far, somehow."]],[3506,["All right."]],[3510,["So a simple thing is,"]],[3513,["first I must tell you the conditions, two conditions."]],[3518,["First one is"]],[3522,["that you are not to feel guilty at all."]],[3526,["You have to forget the past."]],[3528,["You have to be in the present."]],[3532,["Forget the past, forgive yourself."]],[3536,["Because, as I told you, the Divine is the ocean of forgiveness"]],[3541,["and you cannot do anything that cannot be forgiven"]],[3545,["by that greatness of forgiveness."]],[3551,["So please, forgive completely yourself"]],[3556,["and know that you are not guilty at all."]],[3558,["Supposing you were guilty,"]],[3560,["you would have been in jail. Why are you here?"]],[3562,["So now don’t jump on to small, small things,"]],[3565,["which you think is creating guilt."]],[3568,["So not to feel guilty at all, first point."]],[3573,["The second one is that you have to forgive everyone."]],[3577,["Just forgive every one. Not to think whom to forgive,"]],[3580,["why to forgive, what they have done to you."]],[3582,["But just to forgive them, logically to understand is"]],[3586,["that whether you forgive or don’t forgive,"]],[3589,["you don’t do anything."]],[3591,["Whether you forgive someone or don’t forgive,"]],[3594,["you don’t have to do anything about it."]],[3597,["But if you don’t forgive then you play into wrong hands."]],[3601,["I mean actually you are playing into the hands"]],[3604,["who wanted to trouble you."]],[3607,["So when you forgive, that person is out of your mind"]],[3609,["and no tortures anymore left."]],[3612,["So you have to forgive and this is what is the teaching of Christ,"]],[3615,["if you remember, that \"forgive them those who trespass against us"]],[3620,["for we forgive them those who trespass against us\"."]],[3623,["This is a very great weapon Christ has given us."]],[3627,["So from your heart you must just forgive everyone."]],[3631,["These are the only two conditions we have."]],[3638,["All right."]],[3641,["So another thing is that we have to take help of the Mother Earth."]],[3644,["So would be nice if we can take out our shoes at least,"]],[3648,["and keep them on one side."]],[3660,["It is such a truth that we have so many Jews now"]],[3664,["who worship Christ"]],[3666,["and so many Hindus who worship Mohammad Sahab."]],[3671,["Such a truth."]],[3679,["Complete integration."]]]);
